# Binary fixtures and eval resources. Git sniffs for a null byte to decide what is text,
# and a PDF can run for kilobytes without one, so without these lines a clone with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites line endings inside the file and breaks its byte offsets.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.heic binary
*.tiff binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
